<title>SWITZERLAND: Sulzer 1996 oper profit fell 36 percent.</title>
<headline>Sulzer 1996 oper profit fell 36 percent.</headline>
<text>
<p>WINTERHUR, Switzerland, March 18 (Reuter ) - Calendar 1996</p>
<p>   (million Swiss francs)			1996	1995</p>
<p> Operating profit				  110	 173</p>
<p> Cash flow					   185	  48</p>
<p>NOTE - Sulzer AG last week reported 1996 net</p>
<p>profit fell to 82 million Swiss francs from 92 million in 1995</p>
<p>due to extraordinary cost</p>
<p> Sales						5,728    5,740</p>
<p> New orders					 5,522    5,693</p>
<p>NOTE - Sulzer AG last week said it was proposing an unchanged dividend of 12 Swiss francs per registered share and participation certificate</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
